00:14:27,240 --> 00:14:28,080
Well played.

280
00:14:28,100 --> 00:14:29,490
You did your best.

281
00:14:29,860 --> 00:14:31,320
-Well played.
-It's okay.

282
00:14:31,590 --> 00:14:32,560
Not bad.

283
00:14:32,860 --> 00:14:34,160
Guys, thanks for your hard work.

284
00:14:34,160 --> 00:14:36,580
[Do Your Best] [Life is about Exercises]

285
00:14:35,590 --> 00:14:36,480
It's okay.

286
00:14:36,690 --> 00:14:38,550
[Keep fighting]

287
00:14:37,560 --> 00:14:39,560
There's no shame in that. It's okay.

288
00:14:39,920 --> 00:14:41,180
You all did well today.

289
00:14:41,880 --> 00:14:44,120
We gave everyone a wonderful match.

290
00:14:44,640 --> 00:14:46,010
Guys, thanks for your hard work.

291
00:14:46,010 --> 00:14:47,840
Failing to advance directly
to the national tournament this time

292
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:49,920
-is the worst record in JCU's history.
-I'm sorry.

293
00:14:49,920 --> 00:14:50,920
Let me interrupt.

294
00:14:51,760 --> 00:14:54,760
Who said we didn't make it
to the national tournament?

295
00:14:54,880 --> 00:14:57,160
Next, we'll still
have the play-ins to play.

296
00:14:57,160 --> 00:14:59,620
Since we've had
the worst record in history,

297
00:14:59,920 --> 00:15:02,120
we must make a change.

298
00:15:02,400 --> 00:15:03,530
From today onwards,

299
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:06,980
I will no longer be the head coach
of the JCU Team.

300
00:15:07,400 --> 00:15:09,600
-Is that true?
-Head Coach.

301
00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:11,160
When are you going to step down?

302
00:15:11,160 --> 00:15:12,640
Have you thought about the future

303
00:15:12,640 --> 00:15:13,990
of the JCU Basketball Team?

304
00:15:13,990 --> 00:15:14,640
Captain Gu Han,

305
00:15:14,640 --> 00:15:16,080
did you know about this news?

306
00:15:16,080 --> 00:15:17,280
What's next for the JCU Team?

307
00:15:17,280 --> 00:15:19,000
Do you have any suggestions?

308
00:15:21,760 --> 00:15:24,520
Someone more suitable will replace me.

309
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:27,480
Don't we still have the play-ins to play?

310
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:30,200
There's still hope
to advance to the national tournament.

311
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:31,000
I believe

312
00:15:31,600 --> 00:15:34,660
as long as you all don't forget
our previous agreement,

313
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:37,660
the JCU Team
will definitely return to its peak.

314
00:15:56,400 --> 00:15:58,730
Isn't it boring to play basketball alone?

315
00:16:24,800 --> 00:16:28,080
Left hand. Right hand. Squat.

316
00:16:34,800 --> 00:16:35,640
Like this?

317
00:16:37,320 --> 00:16:37,810
Like this?

318
00:16:37,810 --> 00:16:38,400
Yeah.

319
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:42,900
Do it one more time.

320
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:47,000
Watch carefully.

321
00:17:06,240 --> 00:17:07,480
Though you can play basketball so well,

322
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:09,210
you even miss shots sometimes,

323
00:17:09,839 --> 00:17:13,319
so it's normal to win some
or lose some matches.

324
00:17:22,760 --> 00:17:23,760
Drink more water.

325
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:57,800
Tian.

326
00:17:59,840 --> 00:18:01,440
Gu, it's been a long time
since we last met.

327
00:18:00,880 --> 00:18:05,570
[Jiangcheng University
Sports and Cultural Center]

328
00:18:01,440 --> 00:18:03,570
It's been a long time since we last met.

329
00:18:04,040 --> 00:18:04,960
Weren't you in the US?

330
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:06,480
Why are you back so suddenly?

331
00:18:06,480 --> 00:18:07,410
I just came back.

332
00:18:07,700 --> 00:18:09,030
I'm not leaving for now.

333
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:12,160
Then you're back this time to...

334
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:15,800
To lead you guys in the play-ins.

335
00:18:17,120 --> 00:18:17,560
I'm sorry,

336
00:18:17,560 --> 00:18:18,360
Tian.

337
00:18:18,800 --> 00:18:19,800
I've let you down.

338
00:18:20,440 --> 00:18:21,640
You did play badly.

339
00:18:22,120 --> 00:18:24,000
I've watched the video
of that match of yours.

340
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:25,400
You only know one tactic.

341
00:18:25,880 --> 00:18:26,680
But Tian,

342
00:18:27,320 --> 00:18:30,520
this is the tactic we've stuck to
for the past three years.

343
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:32,200
Yeah.

344
00:18:33,160 --> 00:18:34,240
Therefore, losing the match

345
00:18:34,240 --> 00:18:35,840
is not just your own problem.

346
00:18:36,080 --> 00:18:37,100
It's the problem of the entire system

347
00:18:37,100 --> 00:18:39,120
of Jiangcheng University.

348
00:18:40,080 --> 00:18:41,760
With your superb solo skills,

349
00:18:42,800 --> 00:18:44,800
you can certainly guarantee some results.

350
00:18:44,800 --> 00:18:47,330
But you won't
win the championship like this.

351
00:18:47,520 --> 00:18:49,720
So we need to change.

352
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:52,000
You have to change from here.

353
00:18:52,240 --> 00:18:53,040
Gu.

354
00:18:53,920 --> 00:18:55,040
I trained you.

355
00:18:55,170 --> 00:18:57,150
[Jiangcheng University
Sports and Cultural Center]

356
00:18:55,880 --> 00:18:57,280
If we work together,

357
00:18:57,680 --> 00:19:00,010
we'll win more than just one play-in game.

358
00:19:00,680 --> 00:19:02,940
But we need to change our mindsets first.

359
00:19:03,480 --> 00:19:05,840
I've told all the team members

360
00:19:06,320 --> 00:19:09,580
that we'll take a good rest for two days
before coming back.

361
00:19:09,720 --> 00:19:11,480
Tian, I don't want to rest.

362
00:19:11,480 --> 00:19:12,740
I can train right away.

363
00:19:13,040 --> 00:19:14,400
I'm the head coach,

364
00:19:14,400 --> 00:19:16,200
and this is my first task for you.

365
00:19:16,320 --> 00:19:17,120
Got it?

366
00:19:20,400 --> 00:19:21,770
Have a good rest.

367
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:24,720
Relax.

368
00:19:25,430 --> 00:19:27,130
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

369
00:19:29,240 --> 00:19:32,870
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

370
00:19:34,560 --> 00:19:35,320
Xiangxiang.

371
00:19:36,120 --> 00:19:37,680
Tomorrow happens to be the weekend,
doesn't it?

372
00:19:37,680 --> 00:19:39,040
Why don't we go out to have fun?

373
00:19:39,040 --> 00:19:40,720
Consider it
a belated birthday celebration for you.

374
00:19:40,720 --> 00:19:41,880
Sure. Where will we go?

375
00:19:41,880 --> 00:19:44,480
There's a self-service BBQ farmhouse
in the suburbs.

376
00:19:44,480 --> 00:19:46,280
How about we go there to have fun?

377
00:19:46,800 --> 00:19:49,000
I thought the new coach
would make us do extra training.

378
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:50,760
I didn't expect
that we could rest for two days.

379
00:19:50,760 --> 00:19:51,480
Stop thinking about that.

380
00:19:51,480 --> 00:19:53,760
Just think about
where we should go to have fun.

381
00:19:53,760 --> 00:19:56,120
Why don't you join us for the BBQ?

382
00:19:56,120 --> 00:19:56,920
Sure, sure!

383
00:19:57,360 --> 00:19:59,290
Ask Senior Gu Han to go with us, too.

384
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:04,090
Our captain
never participates in such activities.

385
00:20:04,600 --> 00:20:06,600
Not to mention we've lost the match.

386
00:20:06,760 --> 00:20:08,040
You guys didn't see this.

387
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:10,560
He's been practicing in the gym
all day long in the past two days.

388
00:20:10,560 --> 00:20:12,420
I haven't seen him smile, either.

389
00:21:19,560 --> 00:21:20,360
They're here.

390
00:21:22,760 --> 00:21:24,440
-Hi.
-You're here.

391
00:21:24,680 --> 00:21:25,400
Let's go.

392
00:21:25,400 --> 00:21:27,240
Let's go.

393
00:21:44,600 --> 00:21:45,400
Captain?

394
00:21:55,720 --> 00:21:56,780
How does this look?

395
00:21:57,560 --> 00:21:59,680
You already have one in this color.

396
00:21:59,680 --> 00:22:00,940
Have you forgotten it?

397
00:22:01,450 --> 00:22:02,280
Then this one.

398
00:22:02,280 --> 00:22:03,680
I think this one looks pretty good, too.

399
00:22:03,680 --> 00:22:04,610
This one is okay.

400
00:22:05,160 --> 00:22:06,400
This one looks good, too.

401
00:22:06,400 --> 00:22:06,940
What about this one?

402
00:22:06,940 --> 00:22:08,120
It's good. This one.

403
00:22:12,240 --> 00:22:13,800
This one is cute.

404
00:22:15,840 --> 00:22:16,970
Then I'll just buy this one.

405
00:22:16,970 --> 00:22:18,430
Now I'm placing the order.

406
00:22:19,960 --> 00:22:20,960
Brush it lightly.

407
00:22:24,400 --> 00:22:26,040
Xiangxiang, you have no idea

408
00:22:26,280 --> 00:22:28,040
how miserable Li Sirui was today.

409
00:22:28,040 --> 00:22:28,640
He was

410
00:22:29,240 --> 00:22:30,480
defeated by me twice.

411
00:22:32,040 --> 00:22:33,720
Every time I see you guys talking,

412
00:22:33,720 --> 00:22:34,980
I really want to laugh.

413
00:22:35,200 --> 00:22:36,520
Why?

414
00:22:36,520 --> 00:22:38,480
I think you guys are very cute.

415
00:22:41,200 --> 00:22:41,840
Captain,

416
00:22:42,400 --> 00:22:43,720
why don't you park your car here

417
00:22:43,720 --> 00:22:44,580
and drive mine?

418
00:22:45,040 --> 00:22:46,240
I want to have a drink.

419
00:22:46,840 --> 00:22:48,970
You still have to drive them back home.

420
00:22:49,120 --> 00:22:51,380
I'll come with you to pick it up tomorrow.

421
00:22:53,520 --> 00:22:55,920
Then it's a deal.

422
00:23:07,480 --> 00:23:08,280
Just eat.

423
00:23:08,640 --> 00:23:09,520
Thank you.

424
00:23:22,240 --> 00:23:23,040
Hello, Tian.

425
00:23:23,640 --> 00:23:25,640
You sound like you're in a good mood.

426
00:23:26,720 --> 00:23:27,520
Not bad.

427
00:23:28,040 --> 00:23:29,040
How is the BBQ?

428
00:23:30,960 --> 00:23:32,320
Everyone is having a good time.

429
00:23:32,320 --> 00:23:33,680
We can get back to training tomorrow.

430
00:23:33,680 --> 00:23:35,240
Alright. Get a good rest tonight.

431
00:23:35,240 --> 00:23:37,040
-Okay.
-Okay. See you tomorrow.

432
00:23:56,720 --> 00:23:57,360
Tactics?

433
00:24:00,080 --> 00:24:02,040
Are you waiting for me?

434
00:24:03,360 --> 00:24:04,760
I'm talking on the phone.

435
00:24:09,920 --> 00:24:11,120
The car is over there.

436
00:24:22,400 --> 00:24:23,200
Hello, Tian.

437
00:24:24,200 --> 00:24:25,040
Remember.

438
00:24:25,160 --> 00:24:26,640
Don't drive if you've had a drink.

439
00:24:26,640 --> 00:24:27,520
I know.

440
00:24:28,080 --> 00:24:28,840
Okay.

441
00:24:28,840 --> 00:24:29,800
I'm hanging up.

442
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:18,560
Did you drive me here?

443
00:25:19,080 --> 00:25:20,210
Who else could it be?

444
00:25:23,640 --> 00:25:25,440
Then why are you outside the car?

445
00:25:27,000 --> 00:25:28,400
I was afraid you'd snore.

446
00:25:30,920 --> 00:25:33,360
Jiangcheng University TV Station
is taking on a brand new look,

447
00:25:33,360 --> 00:25:35,280
welcoming every student
who wants to be a host

448
00:25:33,970 --> 00:25:36,190
[Jiangcheng University TV Station]

449
00:25:35,280 --> 00:25:37,160
to sincerely join us.

450
00:25:36,220 --> 00:25:37,440
[Fang Yu, Host of the Campus TV Station]

451
00:25:37,240 --> 00:25:40,240
You'll receive the most professional
guidance from our teachers here.

452
00:25:40,240 --> 00:25:41,440
Do you want to join it?

453
00:25:42,280 --> 00:25:43,920
And the most advanced technology.

454
00:25:43,920 --> 00:25:44,560
I'm just taking a look casually.

455
00:25:44,560 --> 00:25:46,160
As well as a strong faculty team.

456
00:25:46,160 --> 00:25:47,440
We're waiting for you to join us.

457
00:25:47,310 --> 00:25:48,870
[Jiangcheng University TV Station]

458
00:25:49,200 --> 00:25:52,660
Then why did you attend
the campus TV station's presentation?

459
00:25:53,240 --> 00:25:54,480
And why did you ask Lin Hong

460
00:25:54,480 --> 00:25:56,560
if she was nervous about hosting?

461
00:25:57,600 --> 00:25:58,800
I almost forgot to ask you

462
00:25:58,800 --> 00:26:00,330
how you got to know Lin Hong.

463
00:26:00,720 --> 00:26:02,450
She and my mom are good friends.

464
00:26:05,160 --> 00:26:06,020
I'm going back.

465
00:26:09,360 --> 00:26:10,680
What's wrong now?

466
00:26:11,680 --> 00:26:13,560
You're usually fearless,

467
00:26:13,800 --> 00:26:17,200
but when it comes to things you like,
you'll just chicken out.

468
00:26:19,880 --> 00:26:21,680
Thanks for driving me back here.

469
00:26:22,560 --> 00:26:23,890
Stay out of my business.

470
00:26:31,760 --> 00:26:33,720
Hello, everyone.

471
00:26:33,720 --> 00:26:36,960
On this beautiful spring day,

472
00:26:36,960 --> 00:26:39,000
I wish you all a happy birthday.

473
00:26:53,200 --> 00:26:55,770
[New Year Gala]

474
00:26:53,640 --> 00:26:54,720
Respected teachers

475
00:26:54,720 --> 00:26:58,440
and dear schoolmates, happy New Year.

476
00:27:03,200 --> 00:27:05,080
You're usually fearless,

477
00:27:05,440 --> 00:27:08,840
but when it comes to things you like,
you'll just chicken out.

478
00:27:14,000 --> 00:27:16,640
Peter Piper
picked a peck of pickled peppers.

479
00:27:17,320 --> 00:27:19,850
A peck of pickled peppers
Peter Piper picked.

480
00:27:19,880 --> 00:27:23,010
Where's the peck of pickled peppers
Peter Piper picked?

481
00:27:27,840 --> 00:27:30,520
She sells seashells by the seashore.

482
00:27:30,640 --> 00:27:33,170
The shells she sells are seashells,
I'm sure.

483
00:27:33,280 --> 00:27:35,680
For if she sells seashells
on the seashore,

484
00:27:35,920 --> 00:27:38,920
Then I'm sure she sells seashore shells.

485
00:27:39,240 --> 00:27:40,280
Xiangxiang.

486
00:27:42,840 --> 00:27:43,800
Senior.

487
00:27:45,320 --> 00:27:46,920
Are you doing vocal exercises?

488
00:27:46,920 --> 00:27:48,440
When did you get here?

489
00:27:49,280 --> 00:27:50,480
I was just passing by.

490
00:27:51,760 --> 00:27:52,680
Are you thinking about

491
00:27:52,680 --> 00:27:55,210
applying to be a host
in our campus TV station?

492
00:27:55,400 --> 00:27:56,920
I have thought about it.

493
00:27:57,840 --> 00:27:58,640
But...

494
00:28:01,120 --> 00:28:03,520
But I'm not
a broadcasting major after all.

495
00:28:03,760 --> 00:28:06,080
So even if I go,
I'll just be making up the numbers.

496
00:28:06,080 --> 00:28:07,200
Let me tell you, Xiangxiang.

497
00:28:07,200 --> 00:28:09,080
No one is born a professional.

498
00:28:09,440 --> 00:28:10,440
I was listening to you just now.

499
00:28:10,440 --> 00:28:12,520
Being at this level
without professional training

500
00:28:12,520 --> 00:28:14,120
is already pretty good.

501
00:28:14,800 --> 00:28:16,560
Your voice has the potential.

502
00:28:16,560 --> 00:28:17,820
If you're interested,

503
00:28:18,000 --> 00:28:18,860
you can tell me.

504
00:28:18,880 --> 00:28:19,680
I can help you.

505
00:28:20,440 --> 00:28:21,520
Really?

506
00:28:21,880 --> 00:28:22,640
Thank you.

507
00:28:23,400 --> 00:28:25,280
Tomorrow happens to be Sunday.

508
00:28:25,840 --> 00:28:27,840
In the morning, we can find a place

509
00:28:28,080 --> 00:28:29,940
to do some vocal exercises first.

510
00:28:34,400 --> 00:28:35,280
Thank you, sir.

511
00:28:42,280 --> 00:28:43,160
Senior.

512
00:28:48,520 --> 00:28:49,720
You're here so early.

513
00:28:50,680 --> 00:28:52,040
I live nearby.

514
00:28:52,120 --> 00:28:54,200
I usually do vocal exercises
up there with my classmates.

515
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:54,920
After thinking about it,

516
00:28:54,920 --> 00:28:56,850
I decided to ask you to meet me here.

517
00:28:57,840 --> 00:28:59,280
Let's learn about abdominal respiration

518
00:28:59,280 --> 00:29:01,160
so that you can know about

519
00:29:01,160 --> 00:29:02,240
your breath better

520
00:29:02,480 --> 00:29:05,080
and use it to support your voice.

521
00:29:06,360 --> 00:29:08,920
I've read about abdominal respiration
in books before,

522
00:29:08,920 --> 00:29:11,120
but I couldn't find the right position.

523
00:29:11,200 --> 00:29:14,200
It's okay. We still have time.
Let's practice slowly.

524
00:29:14,600 --> 00:29:17,480
Next, we'll do a "hey-ha" exercise.

525
00:29:17,480 --> 00:29:18,720
This "hey-ha" exercise

526
00:29:18,720 --> 00:29:20,040
can make your voice

527
00:29:20,040 --> 00:29:21,880
clearer, more stable and more powerful.

528
00:29:21,880 --> 00:29:23,600
Imagine where your target is.

529
00:29:24,520 --> 00:29:24,920
Okay?

530
00:29:25,600 --> 00:29:27,330
I'll give you a demonstration.

531
00:29:29,280 --> 00:29:34,680
Hey, ha, hey, ha, hey, ha, hey, ha!

532
00:29:35,760 --> 00:29:37,000
Give it a try.

533
00:29:38,920 --> 00:29:40,920
Look at the young people these days.

534
00:29:44,160 --> 00:29:45,360
You don't need to be nervous.

535
00:29:45,360 --> 00:29:47,120
Hasn't Senior Lin Hong said that

536
00:29:47,120 --> 00:29:48,360
these external factors

537
00:29:48,360 --> 00:29:51,360
are all necessary steps for you
to become an excellent host?

538
00:29:51,360 --> 00:29:52,240
I got it.

539
00:29:52,560 --> 00:29:53,360
Come on.

540
00:29:55,880 --> 00:29:57,940
Focus on the abdominal respiration.

541
00:29:58,000 --> 00:29:58,800
Ready.

542
00:29:59,680 --> 00:30:00,480
Begin.

543
00:30:01,280 --> 00:30:03,760
Hey, ha, hey, ha!

544
00:30:24,240 --> 00:30:27,080
Xiangxiang, are you tired today?

545
00:30:27,920 --> 00:30:28,720
Not really.

546
00:30:30,200 --> 00:30:31,160
Senior, thank you

547
00:30:31,160 --> 00:30:32,890
for giving me extra help today.

548
00:30:33,880 --> 00:30:34,740
How about this?

549
00:30:34,880 --> 00:30:37,160
I'll treat you to a meal when you're free.

550
00:30:38,000 --> 00:30:38,680
Sure.

551
00:30:39,120 --> 00:30:40,160
Now,

552
00:30:40,160 --> 00:30:41,720
you've accumulated some experience, too.

553
00:30:41,720 --> 00:30:43,980
Do you have time tomorrow during the day?

554
00:30:44,000 --> 00:30:44,800
Yes.

